logger.com/feeds/32869165/4572614139595200025/comments/default/1595474834313155415'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2012/10/remembering-murder-of-donald-scott.html?showComment=1462000165239#c1595474834313155415' title=''/><author><name>Susan Scott</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/17291925195858999102</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/b16-rounded.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2012/10/remembering-murder-of-donald-scott.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-4572614139595200025' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/4572614139595200025' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1076159839"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="April 30, 2016 at 1:09 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-4207499607312663757</id><published>2012-10-29T14:04:09.272-06:00</published><updated>2012-10-29T14:04:09.272-06:00</updated><title type='text'>There is competition, and a change in use, regardi...</title><content type='html'>There is competition, and a change in use, regarding the term goon -- as the police or the gangster.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4572614139595200025/comments/default/4207499607312663757'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4572614139595200025/comments/default/4207499607312663757'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2012/10/remembering-murder-of-donald-scott.html?showComment=1351541049272#c4207499607312663757' title=''/><author><name>Mr. Mcgranor</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/12851136550476241757</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='32' height='32' src='http://4.bp.blogspot.com/-BYbvMXWKgFs/TWRwMaVUxNI/AAAAAAAAABk/-Djx96ZKJvc/s220/150_964816-0.jpg'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2012/10/remembering-murder-of-donald-scott.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-4572614139595200025' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/4572614139595200025' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1659259730"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="October 29, 2012 at 2:04 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-8392458246363328478</id><published>2012-10-08T18:56:45.272-06:00</published><updated>2012-10-08T18:56:45.272-06:00</updated><title type='text'>I guess Bradbury had the &amp;#39;Broken Windows&amp;#39; ...</title><content type='html'>I guess Bradbury had the &amp;#39;Broken Windows&amp;#39; theory partly correct, at least.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;20 years ago a mafia comprised of agents of various state and county and city and federal bureaucracies murdered a man in cold blood in order to steal his possessions.  Like a street filled with shattered glass, no members of the coterie were prosecuted and convicted.  And what&amp;#39;s happened since?  More and more men and women and children (and dogs) murdered by other little mafia-styled &amp;#39;families&amp;#39;.  &lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;I too would love to know what that sicko Gary Spencer is doing with his time these days.  An evil, evil man to do the bidding of the State. </content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4572614139595200025/comments/default/8392458246363328478'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4572614139595200025/comments/default/8392458246363328478'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2012/10/remembering-murder-of-donald-scott.html?showComment=1349744205272#c8392458246363328478' title=''/><author><name>KPRyan</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2012/10/remembering-murder-of-donald-scott.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-4572614139595200025' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/4572614139595200025' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-877036699"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="October 8, 2012 at 6:56 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-3058789847339543778</id><published>2012-10-03T18:11:16.621-06:00</published><updated>2012-10-03T18:11:16.621-06:00</updated><title type='text'>I remember this very well.  Wasn&amp;#39;t there a tel...</title><content type='html'>I remember this very well.  Wasn&amp;#39;t there a television documentary about it?  And where oh where did Mr. Spencer slither off to?</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4572614139595200025/comments/default/3058789847339543778'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4572614139595200025/comments/default/3058789847339543778'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2012/10/remembering-murder-of-donald-scott.html?showComment=1349309476621#c3058789847339543778' title=''/><author><name>MoT</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2012/10/remembering-murder-of-donald-scott.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-4572614139595200025' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/4572614139595200025' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-504210112"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="October 3, 2012 at 6:11 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-6269434794846979278</id><published>2012-10-02T15:12:47.333-06:00</published><updated>2012-10-02T15:12:47.333-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Will,&#xa;A year after the raid that left Mr. Scott de...</title><content type='html'>Will,&lt;br /&gt;A year after the raid that left Mr. Scott dead, a fire whipped through Malibu in 1993. The Scott home was burned to the ground. This why Frances was living in the teepee. Anecdotally, I have heard that the fire authorities commanded firefighters to let it burn. She spoke about the raid at a California Libertarian Party convention a couple of years later. There is a picture and story at </content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4572614139595200025/comments/default/6269434794846979278'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4572614139595200025/comments/default/6269434794846979278'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2012/10/remembering-murder-of-donald-scott.html?showComment=1349212367333#c6269434794846979278' title=''/><author><name>V-Twin News</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/13093122135244325574</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='33' height='11' src='http://2.bp.blogspot.com/_Mc1JOQPW-ck/TDz-nFVDZUI/AAAAAAAAAQg/27m-E3oZ-iI/S220/VTN.jpg'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2012/10/remembering-murder-of-donald-scott.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-4572614139595200025' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/4572614139595200025' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1588363886"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="October 2, 2012 at 3:12 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-4149636812958550555</id><published>2012-10-02T08:52:11.721-06:00</published><updated>2012-10-02T08:52:11.721-06:00</updated><title type='text'>When all you have is a teepee a dog and an acousti...</title><content type='html'>When all you have is a teepee a dog and an acoustic guitar will they finally leave you alone? (rhetorical)</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4572614139595200025/comments/default/4149636812958550555'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4572614139595200025/comments/default/4149636812958550555'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2012/10/remembering-murder-of-donald-scott.html?showComment=1349189531721#c4149636812958550555' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2012/10/remembering-murder-of-donald-scott.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-4572614139595200025' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/4572614139595200025' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-654972371"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="October 2, 2012 at 8:52 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-7216821323644625881</id><published>2012-10-02T07:14:41.489-06:00</published><updated>2012-10-02T07:14:41.489-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Wouldn&amp;#39;t do you any good, non de guerre. They&amp;...</title><content type='html'>Wouldn&amp;#39;t do you any good, non de guerre. They&amp;#39;d just aim for your head. </content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4572614139595200025/comments/default/7216821323644625881'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4572614139595200025/comments/default/7216821323644625881'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2012/10/remembering-murder-of-donald-scott.html?showComment=1349183681489#c7216821323644625881' title=''/><author><name>Abigail</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/11390199784147211769</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='32' height='24' src='http://4.bp.blogspot.com/-JU0x2B_25dU/UGN3KrbULRI/AAAAAAAAAEc/7Iyk33xU0xg/s220/Waterfall.jpg'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2012/10/remembering-murder-of-donald-scott.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-4572614139595200025' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/4572614139595200025' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1596874836"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="October 2, 2012 at 7:14 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-916758201801063687</id><published>2012-10-02T07:02:25.263-06:00</published><updated>2012-10-02T07:02:25.263-06:00</updated><title type='text'>The Nazis were pros at the midnight raid.&#xa;Their ra...</title><content type='html'>The Nazis were pros at the midnight raid.&lt;br /&gt;Their raids were so effective they discarded&lt;br /&gt;the warrant altogether.  &lt;br /&gt;The unasked question in this article is, &lt;br /&gt;&amp;quot;what judge signed the defective warrant allowing the&lt;br /&gt;midnight invasion of Scott&amp;#39;s home?&amp;quot; &lt;br /&gt;Who turned the dogs loose?&lt;br /&gt;Therein lay the primary culprit in this tragedy.&lt;br /&gt;Why is the public never informed about the true&lt;br /&gt;instigators of these crimes?&lt;br /&gt;Any judge who cannot discern a defective warrant&lt;br /&gt;is a public danger, obviously.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4572614139595200025/comments/default/916758201801063687'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4572614139595200025/comments/default/916758201801063687'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2012/10/remembering-murder-of-donald-scott.html?showComment=1349182945263#c916758201801063687' title=''/><author><name>willb</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2012/10/remembering-murder-of-donald-scott.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-4572614139595200025' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/4572614139595200025' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-119742208"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="October 2, 2012 at 7:02 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-3377976602993775436</id><published>2012-10-02T05:12:20.605-06:00</published><updated>2012-10-02T05:12:20.605-06:00</updated><title type='text'>I want to buy a pair of kevlar pajamas.</title><content type='html'>I want to buy a pair of kevlar pajamas.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4572614139595200025/comments/default/3377976602993775436'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4572614139595200025/comments/default/3377976602993775436'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2012/10/remembering-murder-of-donald-scott.html?showComment=1349176340605#c3377976602993775436' title=''/><author><name>non de guerre</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/04336760586691062775</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='26' height='32' src='http://3.bp.blogspot.com/-KmtAo7gibmw/UCCRNwXtGeI/AAAAAAAAAKs/OBWTM4ZXB_E/s220/al_jourgensen6.jpg'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2012/10/remembering-murder-of-donald-scott.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-4572614139595200025' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/4572614139595200025' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-282878078"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="October 2, 2012 at 5:12 AM"/></entry></feed>